---
const socialLinks = [
  { label: 'LinkedIn', href: 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/yjcho/' },
  { label: 'Threads', href: 'https://www.threads.com/@ilmagnificho' },
];

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-ink/12 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-6">
      <!-- Newsletter -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold mb-1">뉴스레터</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink/65 mb-3">
          매주 투자·빌딩 인사이트 받기 — 한국 창업자와 투자자를 위한 실전 메모를 전합니다.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://page.stibee.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-ink text-paper text-xs font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-ink/80 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          뉴스레터 구독하기
        </a>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-ink/30 mt-2">Stibee 가입 후 구독 페이지 URL을 교체하세요</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Social Links -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start md:items-end gap-2">
        {socialLinks.map((link) => (
          <a
            href={link.href}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-sm text-ink/55 hover:text-ink transition-colors"
          >
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-ink/8 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs text-ink/50">&copy; {year} YoongJae. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
